ravenrs-sheet
=============

The code under src/ comes from two projects, brought together as modules of this one crate. The
ravenrs-gridcraft skill and scripts/storytold/ (profile gridcraft) say how it is converted and kept up to date.

GridCraft (https://github.com/storytold/gridcraft), commit c0ee120ac2d9b59630f5abf1151dd9b471fe2926:
the crates core, numfmt, formula, functions, math, model, calc, xlsx, chart, pdf and engine, under
src/ (core is named base here), and their tests under tests/.
First brought at commit dea064b8573a7662a4589d1a20e9504f906f7635.

craft-libs (https://github.com/storytold/craft-libs), commit bb57d422d0bc842cbde430955825553ab7b976f4,
the revision that GridCraft commit uses: the crates cfb, csv, offcrypto, opc, sheet, xls, xml and
zip, under src/craft/, their tests under tests/craft_*, and the fuzzing loop of media-testkit
(src/craft/media_testkit/hostile.rs), for tests only.

